#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:23
msgid "**Compétences techniques**"
msgstr "**Technical skills**"

#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:25
msgid ""
"**Ingénierie SIG & modélisation géospatiale** : expertise Python appliquée à la modélisation "
"atmosphérique, l'automatisation SIG et la conception de modules géospatiaux industriels"
msgstr ""
"**GIS engineering & geospatial modelling**: Python expertise applied to atmospheric modelling, "
"GIS automation and the design of industrial geospatial modules"

#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:27
msgid ""
"**Bases de données spatiales** : <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>PostgreSQL / PostGIS</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>MySQL</code>, conception et administration d'infrastructures de données spatiales "
"(SDI), métadonnées et plans de gestion des données"
msgstr ""
"**Spatial databases**: <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>PostgreSQL / "
"PostGIS</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>MySQL</code>, design "
"and administration of spatial data infrastructures (SDI), metadata and data management plans"

#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:29
msgid ""
"**Serveurs cartographiques & services web** : administration <code style='color:#79C753; "
"background-color: transparent;'>GeoServer</code> sur serveurs <code style='color:#79C753; "
"background-color: transparent;'>Linux</code> — publication de services WMS/WMTS/WFS, API "
"cartographiques et portails Open Data"
msgstr ""
"**Map servers & web services**: administration of <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>GeoServer</code> on <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>Linux</code> — publishing WMS/WMTS/WFS services, mapping APIs and Open Data portals"

#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:31
msgid ""
"**DevOps & CI/CD** : <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>Git</code>, "
"<code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>GitLab</code> (pipelines de "
"compilation et de déploiement, tests automatisés), conteneurisation et déploiement de chaînes de "
"traitement opérationnelles"
msgstr ""
"**DevOps & CI/CD**: <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>Git</code>, <code"
" style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>GitLab</code> (build and deployment "
"pipelines, automated tests), containerisation and deployment of operational processing chains"

#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:33
msgid ""
"**Cartographie web interactive** (front-end) : <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>DeckGL | PyDeck</code>, <code style='color:#FAE03C; background-color: "
"transparent;'>JavaScript</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>Leaflet</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>OpenLayers</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>HTML5</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>CSS</code>"
msgstr ""
"**Interactive web mapping** (front-end): <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>DeckGL | PyDeck</code>, <code style='color:#FAE03C; background-color: "
"transparent;'>JavaScript</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>Leaflet</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>OpenLayers</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>HTML5</code>, <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: "
"transparent;'>CSS</code>"

#: ../../../../Documents/cv/source/skills.md:35
msgid ""
"**Cloud** : <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>Serveurs Linux</code>, "
"<code style='color:#FAE03C; background-color: transparent;'>AWS</code>, <code "
"style='color:#FAE03C; background-color: transparent;'>Azure</code>"
msgstr ""
"**Cloud**: <code style='color:#79C753; background-color: transparent;'>Linux servers</code>, "
"<code style='color:#FAE03C; background-color: transparent;'>AWS</code>, <code "
"style='color:#FAE03C; background-color: transparent;'>Azure</code>"

